A||||2||sluppy123||Raced a Mustang Cobra||||10||
Z||000000||sluppy123||03-23-2001||11:38 PM||||Finally it's starting to look and feel like spring around here(sunny with temps in the 60's). That means it's time to take my GT out of hibernation, clean it up for the shows and have some fun.<P>The day started off great with a trip to the speed shop to top off the Nitrous tank, then on to the Gas station to fill up with 92 octane gas. Driving back from the gas station I pull up to a long red light light,(4 lane divided hwy)Not really paying attention to whats going on, I hear something reving in the right hand lane. I glance over and see a red Mustang cobra(not sure of the year maybe a 98) the driver yells over and asks if I want to race. I say sure but your going to kill me. I ask if it's stock, he says yes, I tell him I'm "Just about stock'<BR>   I reach over to the center console and flip open the remote bottle opener, arm the Nitrous, fish out my remote NOS trigger, and pull the auto tranny into first(I need all the help i can get). <BR>    The apposing light turns yellow, I stand on the brakes hard, and slowly lay on the gas. Light turns green, the cobra rev's hard and just barely spins the tires, I let the brakes go around 3k rpm, launching hard with zero wheel spin, as soon as I'm rolling I floor it and hit the Nitrous. Passing through the intersection I'm about a car length ahead. I hear the cobra shift, I'm up to about 5500 rpm, off the nos, slide it into second, back on the Nos, were dead even as I shift into third, I'm still hard on the nitrous, slowly he begins to pull away around 85mph. I see this race is over so I back off. He slows down as soon as I Let off. I pull up next to him, he give's me a thumbs up and pulls off for a turn.<BR>      That being my first big race of the year I'm pretty happy.<BR>   <P>------------------<BR>-Brian, Toolmaker<BR>Lincoln, NE<BR>85' SC & 87' GT-Leather, Lowered, Nitrous<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=247832&a=7653930&p=37756786&Sequence=0"> ||||reg||10
Z||000001||SWTKSTMS||03-24-2001||01:59 AM||||that is damn impressive. i give you two thumbs up.||||reg||1
